// SFX cue table (roadmap M41; doc 10 §3, doc 05 §8): GameEvent type -> a
// synthesized placeholder blip. `placeholder: true` marks every one of these
// for the purge lint (packages/tools) — real authored audio replaces them by
// swapping this file's `placeholder`/synth fields, zero code change (doc 10's
// own doctrine). `waveform`/`frequencyHz`/`durationMs` are the @crowns/audio
// synth's placeholder recipe, not a real sound description.
